+================================================================================
+                          VISUAL MODE CHEATSHEET
+================================================================================
+ENTERING VISUAL MODE:
+v          - Character-wise visual mode
+V          - Line-wise visual mode
+Ctrl-v     - Block-wise visual mode
+gv         - Reselect last visual selection
+
+NAVIGATION IN VISUAL MODE:
+o          - Jump to other end of selection
+O          - Jump to other corner (block mode)
+All normal motions work (w, b, e, f, /, etc.)
+
+VISUAL MODE OPERATORS:
+d          - Delete selection
+c          - Change selection
+y          - Yank selection
+p          - Replace selection with register
+>          - Indent right
+<          - Indent left
+=          - Auto-indent
+u          - Lowercase
+U          - Uppercase
+~          - Toggle case
+J          - Join lines
+gq         - Format/wrap text
+:          - Command on selection
+
+BLOCK MODE SPECIAL:
+I          - Insert at start of each line
+A          - Append at end of each line
+c          - Change block (replace)
+r{char}    - Replace all chars with {char}
+$          - Extend to end of all lines
+
+TEXT OBJECTS IN VISUAL:
+vaw        - Select a word
+viw        - Select inner word
+vi"        - Select inside quotes
+va(        - Select around parentheses
+vip        - Select inner paragraph
+vat        - Select around tag
